  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Making Decentralisation Work&quot; syftar till att st&#xE4;rka nationella decentraliseringsprocesser i Senegal, Mali, Burkina Faso och Niger genom st&#xE4;rkt lokal demokrati och h&#xE5;llbarhet i f&#xF6;rvaltning av naturresurser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i&quot;Making Decentralisation Work&quot;. Aim is to influence on-going decentralisation processes in Senegal, Mali, Burkina Faso and Niger towards democratisation ans sustanability in the management of natural resources.</narrative>
  </description>
